# Accidentally vendored site-packages fragments — guard against recurrence of the
# pre-rc.7 "dump site-packages into the source tree" bug (see Version History
# entry for 4.50.0-rc.7 for the purge rationale). Anchored to repo root so a
# legitimate same-named subfolder deeper in the tree is not accidentally hidden.
/Python
/Python.framework/
/webview/
/jsonschema/
/jsonschema_specifications/
/certifi/
.specify/
.cursor/

# Agent harness: rule content lives in .rules/ (vendor-neutral). Claude Code only
# auto-loads path-scoped rules from .claude/rules, so that is a symlink to it.
# Keep the symlink tracked; ignore local tooling state.
.claude/*
!.claude/rules
!.claude/settings.json

openspec/changes/archive

# A runtime database written by a test run that used the repo as its data root.
state/

HANDOFF.md
.venv*
